Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们该邀请她过来吃午餐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. We're gonna start season two of Battlestar Galactica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我们得开始看 第二季的《星际大争霸》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We already watched the season two DVDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们已经看过第二季的DVD
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not with commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但没看过讲评
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:23.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we should be good neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:23.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们该当好邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:25.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Invite her over, make her feel welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:25.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}邀请她过来 欢迎她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We never invited Louie/Louise over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没邀请 又名为露易丝的路易过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:32.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, and that was wrong of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:32.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我们的错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:33.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need to widen our circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:33.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得拓展社交圈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a very wide circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的社交圈很广
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:40.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have 212 friends on MySpace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:40.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在MySpace 有两百一十二个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:43.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, and you've never met one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:43.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你没跟他们见过面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the beauty of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好就好在这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna invite her over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要邀请她过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll have a nice meal and chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得好好吃饭聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:56.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chat? We don't chat, at least not off-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:56.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聊天？我们在线下是不聊天的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's not difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么难的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just listen to what she says...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只要听她在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then you say something appropriate in response.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后说些适当的话做回应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:06.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To what end?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:06.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么做有什么好处吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. Again. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 又见面了 -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:17.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we brought home Indian food...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:17.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们买了印度菜回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I know that moving can be stressful...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道搬家很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:22.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I find that when I'm undergoing stress...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:22.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发现面对压力的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:26.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that good food and company can have a comforting effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:26.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}食物跟同伴有安慰效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:31.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also, curry's a natural laxative and I don't have to tell you that, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:31.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}咖哩是天然泻药 我不必告诉你那一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a clean colon is just one less thing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干净的直肠让你烦恼少少
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm no expert, but in the context of a lunch invitation...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是专家 但在邀请别人 一起吃午餐的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you might wanna skip the reference to bowel movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不该提起通便效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:45.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're inviting me over to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:45.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是在邀请我过去吃饭？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:49.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's so nice. I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:49.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的太棒了 我愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:53.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you guys do for fun around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:53.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都做什么消遣？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, today we tried masturbating for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天我们本来想打个飞机赚点钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, well, make yourself at home. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 请随意 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:28.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:28.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:31.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MOUTHS] You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:31.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This looks like some serious stuff. Leonard, did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这看起来像是很严肃的东西 莱纳德 这是你写的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:37.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, that's my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:37.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上那是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:41.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, it's just some quantum mechanics...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:41.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那只是量子力学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:45.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a little string theory doodling around the edges. That part's just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:45.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加上一些弦理论做推算根据 那部分只是在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:48.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a spoof of the Born-Oppenheimer approximation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:48.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是玻恩奥本海默近似法的玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you're, like, one of those Beautiful Mind genius guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们就像是《美丽心灵》里的天才
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:55.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:55.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:57.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:57.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真的是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:01.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a board, if you like boards. This is my board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也有个白板 如果你喜欢的话 这是我的白板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Holy smokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If by "holy smokes," you mean a derivative restatement of the stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果由“我的天啊” 导出的声明就是你很佩服我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:10.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you can find scribbled on the wall of any men's room at MIT, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:10.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该看看麻省理工学院 男生厕所墙上的涂鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -少来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who hasn't seen this differential below "here I sit brokenhearted"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁看不出来你在想 “我伤心地坐在这里”？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least I didn't have to invent 26 dimensions just to make the math come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少我不必发明26度空间 才能做出计算结果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I didn't invent them. They're there. -In what universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没有发明它们 它们真的存在 -在哪个宇宙？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In all of them, that is the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在所有宇宙 那就是重点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:28.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you guys mind if I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:28.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不介意我先吃吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny. -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's where I sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:34.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So sit next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:34.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐到我旁边来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, I sit there. -What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 我坐在那里 -那有什么差别？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:43.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the difference? -Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:43.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有什么差别？ -又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:46.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In winter, that seat is close enough to the radiator to remain warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:46.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冬天那个位置够接近暖气 所以很温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.47,0:07:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...yet not so close as to cause perspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.47,0:07:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不会太过接近 导致汗出如浆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:53.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the summer, it's in a cross breeze created by opening windows there and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:53.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}夏天打开那边跟那边的窗户 风刚好会吹过那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It faces the television at an angle that is neither direct, discouraging conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:57.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那里面对电视机的角度 不会太直接 让人不想跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:08:00.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...nor so far wide as to create a parallax distortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:08:00.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不会太远导致视差失真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could go on, but I think I've made my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以继续说 但我想你了解我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:07.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want me to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:07.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想让我挪开吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well.... -Just sit somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗯… -坐别的位置吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this is nice. We don't have a lot of company over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这真的太好了 -我们的客人不多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:44.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not true. Koothrappali and Wolowitz come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:44.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是真的 库萨帕里跟沃洛维茨常过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 我知道 -星期二晚上我们会玩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tuesday night we played Klingon Boggle until 1 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克林贡拼字游戏直到凌晨一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, I remember. -I resent you saying we don't have company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 我记得 -我不喜欢你说我们没有客人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:53.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That has a negative social implication. -I said I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:53.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是负面的社交暗示 -我都说对不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:55.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:55.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:57.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Klingon Boggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:57.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克林贡拼字游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:09:02.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. It's like regular Boggle, but in Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:09:02.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 那是一般的拼字游戏 但发生在克林贡星上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:07.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's probably enough about us. So tell us about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:07.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们说得够多了 跟我们聊聊你自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吗？好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a Sagittarius, which probably tells you way more than you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是射手座 或许那会让你们太过了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:17.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it tells us that you participate in the mass cultural delusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:17.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她让我们知道 你参与大众文化妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that the sun's position relative to arbitrary constellations...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}觉得你出生时 太阳跟星座的相对位置
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:24.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at the time of your birth somehow affects your personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:24.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会影响到你的个性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:28.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Participate in the what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:28.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}参与什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think what Sheldon's trying to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想谢尔顿的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:33.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is that Sagittarius wouldn't have been our first guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:33.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没想到你是射手座
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:35.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, a lot of people think I'm a water sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:35.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 很多人以为我是水象星座
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's see, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 让我想想 还有什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm a vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:39.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吃素
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, except for fish, and the occasional steak. I love steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 除了鱼之外 偶尔我会吃牛排 我喜欢牛排
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真是有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard can't process corn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德没办法消化玉米
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So do you have some sort of a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有工作吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:58.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a waitress at The Cheesecake Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:58.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是芝乐坊的服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢芝士蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:03.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're lactose intolerant. -I don't eat it, I think it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:03.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有乳糖不耐症 -我不吃 但我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyways, I'm also writing a screenplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之我也在写剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's about this sensitive girl who comes to L.A. from Lincoln, Nebraska...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}故事描述来自内布拉斯加州 林肯市的敏感女孩到了洛杉矶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to be an actress and winds up a waitress at The Cheesecake Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她想当演员 最后在芝乐坊当服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So it's based on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是你的人生故事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm from Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我来自奥马哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:25.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If that was a movie, I would go see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:25.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果能拍成电影 我倒想看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:26.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:26.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's see, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 让我想想 还有什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:34.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the story of Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:34.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是佩妮的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:39.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:39.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:42.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Until I fell in love with a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:42.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但后来我爱上一个烂人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MOUTHS] I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:52.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, you know, four years I lived with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:52.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我跟他同居了四年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Four years. That's like as long as high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}四年 那跟高中一样长
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:58.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It took you four years to get through high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:58.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要花四年才读完高中？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just-- I can't believe I trusted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信我居然信任他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:10.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Should I say something? I feel I should say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:10.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该说话吗？ 我觉得我该说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You? No, you'll only make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你？不 你只会 让事情变得更糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:14.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna know the most pathetic part?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:14.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道最惨的是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:18.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even though I hate his lying, cheating guts...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:18.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我讨厌他爱说谎跟劈腿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I still love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是爱他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:22.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:22.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那很疯狂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:23.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:23.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's not crazy. It's a--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那不疯狂 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a paradox.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那叫悖论
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Paradoxes are part of nature. I mean, think about light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}悖论是天性 拿光来说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you look at Huygens, light is a wave, as confirmed by the double-slit experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在惠更斯原理中 光是波 由双狭缝实验加以证实
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then, along comes Albert Einstein...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来出现了爱因斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:44.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and discovers that light behaves like particles too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:44.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他发现光也有粒子特性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:49.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I didn't make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:49.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有让情况变得更糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm so sorry I'm such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉我失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:55.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And on top of everything else, I'm all gross from moving...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:55.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最糟糕的是 我搬家弄得一身汗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and my stupid shower doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的浴室不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our shower works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的浴室能用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:02.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Would it be totally weird if I used it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:02.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？ 我借用会不会很奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-会 -不会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:04.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:04.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不会？ -不会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:06.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:06.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's right down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在走廊尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:11.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys are really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:11.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都是大好人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:20.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this is an interesting development.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:20.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是有趣的发展
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:25.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: It has been some time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:25.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经很久…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...since we've had a woman take her clothes off in our apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有女人 在我们的公寓里脱衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not true. Remember at Thanksgiving...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是真的 还记得感恩节的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:34.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my grandmother with Alzheimer's had that episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:34.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得了老年痴呆症的奶奶 发病的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:39.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Point taken. It has been some time since we've had a woman take her clothes off...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:39.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是没错 已经很久 没有女人在我们公寓脱光衣服后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:42.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...after which we didn't wanna rip our eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:42.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我们不想把眼珠子挖掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:46.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The worst part was watching her carve that turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:46.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最糟糕的是看着她切火鸡肉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:50.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what exactly are you trying to accomplish here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:50.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:51.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:51.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:54.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That woman in there is not going to have sex with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:54.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}里面那个女人不会跟你上床
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm not trying to have sex with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有要跟她上床
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:59.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good. Then you won't be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:59.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 那么你就不会失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What makes you think she wouldn't have sex with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么你觉得她不会跟我上床？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:04.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a male and she's a female.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:04.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是男人 她是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but not of the same species.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但不是同一种类的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:10.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna engage in hypotheticals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:10.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不回答假设性问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:14.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm just trying to be a good neighbor. -Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:14.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我只是要当好邻居 -那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:17.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not to say that if a carnal relationship were to develop...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:17.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是说 如果有肉体关系发展的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:20.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that I wouldn't participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:20.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会拒绝掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}However briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:22.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不管时间多短
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.93,0:13:26.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think this possibility will be hindered...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.93,0:13:26.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她发现了 你的卢克天行者不流泪洗发水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:30.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when she discovers your Luke Skywalker "no more tears" shampoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:30.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得这个可能性会提高或降低？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Darth Vader shampoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是黑武士洗发水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:34.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Luke Skywalker's the conditioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卢克天行者是护发素
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wait till you see this. -It's fantastic. Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-瞧瞧这个 -太棒了 不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:43.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:43.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:48.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a Stephen Hawking lecture from MIT in 1974.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:48.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯蒂芬霍金一九七四年 在麻省理工学院的演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This isn't a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在不是好时机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:52.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IMITATING COMPUTERIZED VOICE] It's before he became...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:52.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那时他还不需要靠电脑说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a creepy computer voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's great, you guys have to go. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太棒了 你们得离开 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:01.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's just not a good time. -Leonard has a lady over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:01.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-现在时机不对 -莱纳德邀请了一位女士过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN NORMAL VOICE] Yeah, right. Your grandmother back in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你奶奶回来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:10.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she's not a lady, she's just a new neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:10.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她也不是女士 她只是新邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:13.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, there really is a lady here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:13.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 这里真的有女士？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh-huh. -And you want us out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:16.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我们离开 因为你预期会有超友谊关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:16.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because you're anticipating coitus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm not anticipating coitus. -So she's available for coitus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没预期会有超友谊关系 -她可以有超友谊关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we please just stop saying "coitus"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们能不能别提超友谊关系了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Technically, that would be coitus interruptus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}严格来说应该是性交行为
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, is there a trick to getting it to switch from tub to shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该怎么从放水功能 变成莲蓬头功能？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hi, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈喽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Enchanté, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:36.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}您好 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard Wolowitz, CalTech Department of Applied Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:41.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德沃洛维茨 加州理工学院应用物理系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You may be familiar with some of my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你看过我的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's currently orbiting Jupiter's largest moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在正绕着木星最大的卫星公转…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:49.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...taking high-resolution digital photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:49.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能传回高解析度数字照片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny. I work at The Cheesecake Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我在芝乐坊工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'll show you the trick with the shower. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:55.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我教你怎么使用淋浴 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN FRENCH]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's French for "good shower."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是法语的“祝你洗澡愉快”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:03.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a sentiment I can express in six languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:03.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以用六国语言说出这句话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:06.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Save it for your blog, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:06.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}留到你的博客上说吧 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: All right, there it goes. It sticks, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 可以了 已经调整好了 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, thanks. -You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好的 谢谢 -不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:20.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're just gonna step right--? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:20.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要进…好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Hey, Leonard? -The hair products are Sheldon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -洗发水是谢尔顿的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:29.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Um, can I ask you a favor? -A favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:29.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我能请你帮个忙吗？ -帮忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:32.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, you could ask me a favor. I would do you a favor for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:32.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 你可以请我帮忙 我很乐意帮你忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:37.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's okay if you say no. -Oh, I'll probably say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:37.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你可以拒绝 -或许我会答应
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just not the kind of thing you ask a guy you just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我通常不会请刚认识的男人 帮我这样的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:43.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:50.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really think we should examine the chain of causality here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:50.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的觉得 我们该检视一下连锁反应
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:51.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Must we? -Event A:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:51.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是吗？ -事件一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A beautiful woman stands naked in our shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一位美女赤裸裸地站在我们的浴室里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Event B: We drive halfway across town to retrieve a television set...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事件二 我们要开车到城对面搬电视机
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from the aforementioned woman's ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟上述那个女人的前男友要回它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Query: On what plane of existence is there even a semi-rational link...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题是这些事件之间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...between these events?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有任何半合理的关联吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:08.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She asked me to do her a favor, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:08.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她要我帮忙 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that may be the proximal cause of our journey...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许那是我们出门的近因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:14.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but we both know it exists in contradistinction...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:14.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们都知道更深一层的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:16.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the higher-level distal cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:16.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}充满了矛盾性
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:19.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Which is? -You think with your penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:19.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-也就是说？ -你用小弟弟思考
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:23.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a biological impossibility, and you didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:23.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那在生物学上是不可能的 你根本不必跟来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes. I could have stayed behind to watch Wolowitz hit on Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我可以待在家里看沃洛维茨撩佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:28.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in Russian, Arabic and Farsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:28.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}炫耀他的俄语、阿拉伯语跟波斯语
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And why can't she get her own TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么她不自己去搬电视机？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, you know how it is with breakups.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得了 你知道分手是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't, and neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不知道 你也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I-- I broke up with Joyce Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟乔伊丝金分手过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:41.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did not break up with Joyce Kim. She defected to North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:41.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有跟乔伊丝金分手 她叛逃到朝鲜去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:44.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To mend her broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:44.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她心碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:49.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This situation is much less complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:49.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次情况不那么复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:52.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's some dispute between Penny and her ex-boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:52.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮跟前男友有摩擦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as to who gets custody of the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}争夺电视机的监护权
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-She just wanted to avoid a scene with him. -So we get to have a scene with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她不想跟他吵架 -我们就得跟他吵架？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Sheldon, there's not going to be a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 谢尔顿 我们不会跟他吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:02.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's two of us and one of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:02.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有两个人 他只有一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:05.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, the two of us can't even carry a TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:05.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我们两个连电视机都搬不动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you guys work with Leonard and Sheldon at the university?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是莱纳德跟谢尔顿 在大学里的同事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:18.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, do you speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:18.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 你会说英语吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:21.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he speaks English. He just can't speak to women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:21.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他会说英语 他只是无法跟女人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:23.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:23.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's kind of a nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个书呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:30.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Juice box?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:30.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}果汁？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:37.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'll do the talking. MAN: Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:37.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我来说话 -什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. I'm Leonard, this is Sheldon. -Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是莱纳德 他是谢尔顿 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did I just--?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:46.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We're here to pick up Penny's TV. -Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:46.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们来搬佩妮的电视机 -滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:47.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, thanks for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:47.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢谢你跟我们谈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We're not gonna give up just like that. -Leonard, the TV's in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们不会就这样子放弃 -莱纳德 电视机在大楼里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:54.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've been denied access to the building, ergo we are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:54.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们无法进到里面 我们一点办法都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:58.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. If I were to give up at the first hitch, I never would have identified...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:58.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 如果一开始我就放弃 我永远找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the fingerprints of string theory in the aftermath of the big bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大爆炸之后的弦理论证据
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:05.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My apologies. What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:05.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:22.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just a privilege to watch your mind at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:22.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很荣幸看你运用智力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, we have a combined IQ of 360.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧 我们的智商 加起来有360
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:29.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should be able to figure out how to get into a stupid building.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:29.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该想出办法 进入愚蠢的建筑物里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:32.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BUZZES]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:36.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you think their combined IQ is? -Just grab the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:36.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你觉得她们的智商加起来有多高？ -快进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:42.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good thinking, I'll just be the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好办法 我负责出力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:55.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah? -I'm Leonard, this is Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:55.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么事？ -我是莱纳德 他是谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:57.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From the intercom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:57.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们刚刚通过对讲机聊过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:01.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How the hell did you get in the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:01.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们怎么进来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:03.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're scientists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:03.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell him about our IQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉他我们的智商
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-My mom bought me those pants. -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是我妈帮我买的裤子 -对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:27.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna have to call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:27.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得打电话给她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:33.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I am so sorry I dragged you through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:33.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 真的很抱歉我把你扯进这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's okay. It wasn't my first pantsing and it won't be my last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 这不是我第一次被脱裤子 也不会是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you were right about my motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你对我的动机推测是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:42.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was hoping to establish a relationship with Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:42.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望能跟佩妮建立关系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that might have someday led to sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以有一天也许能跟她发生性行为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:48.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Well, you got me out of my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:48.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果你脱掉我的裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:53.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I've learned my lesson. She's out of my league, I'm done with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:53.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之我学会了教训 我高攀不上她 我放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:54.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:54.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我努力过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.07,0:19:58.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One day I'll win the Nobel Prize and then I'll die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.07,0:19:58.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有天我会拿到诺贝尔奖 然后孤单地死去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't think like that. You're not going to die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别那么想 你不会孤单死去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:04.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, Sheldon. You're a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:04.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你 谢尔顿 你是个好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: And you're certainly not gonna win a Nobel Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然你也不会拿诺贝尔奖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is one of my favorite places to kick back after a quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:12.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是冒险后 我最喜欢去的休闲地点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They have a great house ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们的麦芽啤酒很好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Wow, cool tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好酷的老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I've had him since Level 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从十级就开始养了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His name is Buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:21.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它叫做钮扣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:23.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, if you had your own game character...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:23.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 如果你有自己的游戏角色
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:26.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we could hang out, maybe go on a quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:26.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以常见面 或是一起去冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That sounds interesting. -So you'll think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听起来很有趣 -你会考虑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I don't think I'll be able to stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我没办法不去考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:37.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:37.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:41.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We're home. -Oh, my God. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:41.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们回来了 -天啊 发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:47.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, your ex-boyfriend sends his regards and I think the rest is fairly self-explanatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:47.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的前男友跟你问好 我想剩下的部分你应该懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:52.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really thought if you guys went instead of me he wouldn't be such an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:52.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为如果你们代替我去 他不会做得太过分
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it was a valid hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是有可能成立的假设
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was a valid hypo--? What is happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是有可能成…你是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:01.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really, thank you so much for going and trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:01.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的谢谢你们帮我这个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:05.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just-- You're so terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:05.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真的是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you put some clothes on, I'll get my purse, and dinner is on me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们何不去穿裤子？ 我去拿钱包 晚餐我请客 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:11.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? Great. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:11.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？太棒了 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:13.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:13.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:20.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not done with her, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:20.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不会放弃 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:24.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our babies will be smart and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:24.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的孩子会聪明又漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:29.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not to mention imaginary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:29.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更别提有想象力了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is Thai food okay with you, Penny? -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你能吃泰国菜吗 佩妮？ -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:38.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't have Thai, we had Indian for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:38.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能吃泰国菜 中午我们吃的印度菜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -They're both curry-based cuisines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -它们都是咖哩料理
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:43.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -It would be gastronomically redundant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:43.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -那在烹饪上造成累赘
